  "lyrics": "You're sitting in the corner crying like a lil bitch boy\nTalking big game but you acting like a toy\nThought you was a legend till the pressure came around\nNow you crying on the floor without a sound\nRunning out of excuses, running out of time\nAll your fake tough talk ain't worth a dime\nStop crying lil bitch boy, stand up on your feet\nOr get swallowed by the shadows on the street",
